WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.520
- So Sydney Powell is back in the news

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.550
for saying something incredibly crazy.

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.470
She is apparently going
around telling people

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.610
that Former President Trump

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.800
can simply be reinstated as president

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.860
and he will be president
as soon as this summer.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:12.797
She said, specifically,

00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:14.447
"This is the first case of abject fraud

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.527
"and obtaining a coup from
the United States of America,

00:00:16.527 --> 00:00:18.177
"so it's going to have to be dealt with.

00:00:18.177 --> 00:00:20.267
"It should be that he
can simply be reinstated,

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:22.297
"that a new inauguration day is set

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:24.087
"and Biden is told to move
out of the White House

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:26.150
"and President Trump should move back in."

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.760
Uh, yeah, that is not a thing.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.890
That is not only the law, there
is no mechanism whatsoever

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.680
that that could possibly happen.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.710
Yeah, that is just hilariously dumb.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:37.810
That is not a thing.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.160
That's not going to happen.

